ies_title\":\"Claude Model Release\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXCLAUDE-MYTH\",\"event_subtitle\":\"Mythos\",\"event_title\":\"When will Anthropic release Mythos?\",\"category\":\"Science and Technology\",\"product_metadata\":{\"categories\":[\"Science and Technology\"],\"important_info\":{\"id\":\"KXCLAUDE-MYTH-2026-06-09\",\"markdown\":\"**Important information:** To satisfy the Payout Criterion, Anthropic must release to the public a model named \\\"Mythos.\\\" Both conditions must be met by the same model:\\n\\nName. The model must be named \\\"Mythos\\\" (e.g., \\\"Claude Mythos 5\\\"). A model that Anthropic describes as \\\"Mythos-class\\\" or as belonging to the Mythos tier, but that carries a different name (e.g., \\\"Claude Fable 5\\\"), does not satisfy the Payout Criterion, even if Anthropic states it is the same underlying model with modified safety features.\\n\\nPublic release. A release restricted to a closed beta or to a limited set of approved or trusted organizations does not constitute a release to the public. A release available to the general public, including a release limited to a paid subscription tier, does constitute a release to the public.\\n\\nAccordingly, Anthropic's June 9, 2026 announcement does not satisfy the Payout Criterion: Claude Fable 5 was released to the public but is not named Mythos, and Claude Mythos 5 is currently restricted to a limited set of approved organizations. The market will remain open. If a model named \\\"Mythos\\\" becomes available to the public before the relevant date, the Contract will resolve in accordance with its terms.\\n\",\"message\":\"\",\"title\":\"\"},\"layout_type_override\":null,\"promoted_milestone_id\":\"16e287a4-e3ae-4443-b946-cca73af1b16c\",\"reduced_pre_live_fees\":false,\"scope\":null,\"series_frequency\":\"one_off\",\"series_grouping_override\":null,\"series_tags\":[\"AI\"],\"stat_format\":null,\"stat_series\":null,\"subcategories\":{\"Science and Technology\":[\"AI\"]}},\"product_metadata_der