\":\"Will OpenAI release Astra 6.1 before Nov 6, 2026?\",\"icon_url_dark_mode\":\"https://kalshi-fallback-images.s3.amazonaws.com/structured_icons/dark_diamond.webp\",\"icon_url_light_mode\":\"https://kalshi-fallback-images.s3.amazonaws.com/structured_icons/diamond.webp\",\"background_color_light_mode\":\"#265CFF\",\"background_color_dark_mode\":\"#408FFF\",\"previous_price\":19,\"previous_price_dollars\":\"0.1900\",\"volume\":142100}],\"is_trending\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_closing\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"search_score\":19327,\"fee_type\":\"quadratic\",\"fee_multiplier\":1,\"tags\":[\"AI\"]},{\"type\":\"contract\",\"recent_volume\":6471,\"series_ticker\":\"KXCLAUDE\",\"series_title\":\"Claude Model Release\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXCLAUDE-MYTH\",\"event_subtitle\":\"Mythos\",\"event_title\":\"When will Anthropic release Mythos?\",\"category\":\"Science and Technology\",\"product_metadata\":{\"categories\":[\"Science and Technology\"],\"important_info\":{\"id\":\"KXCLAUDE-MYTH-2026-06-09\",\"markdown\":\"**Important information:** To satisfy the Payout Criterion, Anthropic must release to the public a model named \\\"Mythos.\\\" Both conditions must be met by the same model:\\n\\nName. The model must be named \\\"Mythos\\\" (e.g., \\\"Claude Mythos 5\\\"). A model that Anthropic describes as \\\"Mythos-class\\\" or as belonging to the Mythos tier, but that carries a different name (e.g., \\\"Claude Fable 5\\\"), does not satisfy the Payout Criterion, even if Anthropic states it is the same underlying model with modified safety features.\\n\\nPublic release. A release restricted to a closed beta or to a limited set of approved or trusted organizations does not constitute a release to the public. A release available to the general public, including a release limited to a paid subscription tier, does constitute a release to the public.\\n\\nAccordingly, Anthropic's June 9, 2026 announcement does not satisfy the Payout Criterion: Claude Fable 5 was released to the public but is not named Mythos, and Claude Mythos 5 is currently restricted to a limited set of approved organizations. The market will remain open. If a model named \\\"Mythos\\\" becomes available to the public before the relevant date, the Contract will resolve in accordance with its terms.\\n\",\"message\":\"\",\"title\":\"\"},\"layout_type_override\":null,\"promoted_milestone_id\":\"16e287a4-e3ae-4443-b946-cca73af1b16c\",\"reduced_pre_live_fees\":false,\"scope\":null,\"series_frequency\":\"one_off\",\"series_grouping_override\":null,\"series_tags\":[\"AI\"],\"stat_format\":null,\"stat_series\":null,\"subcategories\":{\"Science and Technology\":[\"AI\"]}},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"total_series_volume\":2608639,\"total_volume\":2140893,\"total_market_count\":8,\"active_market_count\":2,\"markets\":[{\"ticker\":\"KXCLAUDE-MYTH-27JAN01\",\"yes_subtitle\":\"Before Jan 1, 2027\",\"yes_bid\":4,\"yes_ask\":7,\"last_price\":3,\"yes_bid_dollars\":\"0.0400\",\"yes_ask_dollars\":\"0.0700\",\"last_price_dollars\":\"0.0300\",\"price_delta\":-4,\"close_ts\":\"2027-01-01T04:59:00Z\",\"expected_expiration_ts\":\"2027-01-01T15:00:00Z\",\"open_ts\":\"2026-04-16T02:00:00Z\",\"rulebook_variables\":{},\"result\":\"\",\"score\":444,\"market_id\":\"\",\"title\":\"Will Anthropic release Mythos before Jan 1, 2027?\",\"icon_url_dark_mode\":\"https://kalshi-fallback-images.s3.amazonaws.com/structured_icons/dark_diamond.webp\",\"icon_url_light_mode\":\"https://kalshi-fallback-images.s3.amazonaws.com/structured_icons/diamond.webp\",\"background_color_light_mode\":\"#00B5D9\",\"background_color_dark_mode\":\"#00CBCC\",\"previous_price\":7,\"previous_price_dollars\":\"0.0700\",\"volume\":621666},{\"ticker\":\"KXCLAUDE-MYTH-26DEC01\",\"yes_subtitle\":\"Before Dec 1, 2026\",\"yes_bid\":4,\"yes_ask\":5,\"last_price\":7,\"yes_bid_dollars\":\"0.0400\",\"yes_ask_dollars\":\"0.0500\",\"last_price_dollars\":\"0.0700\",\"price_delta\":4,\"close_ts\":\"2026-12-01T04:59:00Z\",\"expected_e