"startedDateTime": "2026-11-03T12:21:56.710Z", "_original_index": 165, "request": {"method": "GET", "url": "https://api.elections.kalshi.com/v1/search/series?derivative_type=margin&order_by=trending", "httpVersion": "http/2.0", "headers": [{"name": "accept", "value": "*/*"}, {"name": "origin", "value": "https://kalshi.com"}, {"name": "_present_security_headers", "value": "x-aws-waf-token"}], "queryString": [], "cookies": [], "headersSize": -1, "bodySize": 0}, "response": {"status": 200, "statusText": "", "httpVersion": "http/2.0", "headers": [{"name": "access-control-allow-origin", "value": "https://kalshi.com"}, {"name": "access-control-expose-headers", "value": "X-Csrf-Token,Etag"}, {"name": "cache-control", "value": "public, max-age=60"}, {"name": "content-security-policy", "value": "default-src 'none';"}, {"name": "content-type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"}, {"name": "vary", "value": "Origin,Accept-Language,Accept-Encoding"}], "cookies": [], "content": {"mimeType": "application/json", "text": "{\"total_results_count\":28,\"current_page\":[{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Indices\",\"category\":\"Indices\",\"contract_size\":0.0001,\"derived_decimal_count\":0,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXUSTECH100PERP\",\"event_title\":\"US Tech 100\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":3.4991,\"leverage_estimate\":10.5644,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":10.5644,\"10000\":10.5644,\"100000\":10.5644,\"1000000\":10.5644},\"market_id\":\"01a11c78-1b3e-7b33-833f-c905fe767b7e\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":3.5685,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"US Tech 100\",\"categories\":[\"Indices\"],\"category\":\"Indices\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#80A452FF\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#80A452FF\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00A452FF\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00A452FF\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#A452FF\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#A452FF\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-30/KXUSTECH100PERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Kalshi offers exposure to large U.S. technology and growth companies through Kalshi's US Tech 100 index perpetual future. The underlying index is calculated by MerQube (https://merqube.com/indices/MQBUSTQT), which has historically shown 99%+ daily-return correlation with major U.S. technology benchmarks, including the Nasdaq-100\u00ae. It's a total return index, which means dividends are reinvested back into the index.\\n\\nThe index is made up of 100 large non-financial companies, many of them in technology. It is weighted by market capitalization, so the biggest companies like Nvidia, Meta and Google move the price much more than smaller ones. Because the index is concentrated in fewer companies and sectors than a broad 500-company index, it can move more sharply in either direction.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Earnings from the largest tech companies, spending on AI and data centers, Federal Reserve interest-rate decisions, and monthly inflation reports.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 16 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"MerQube US Tech 100 TR Index\",\"keywords\":[\"us tech 100\",\"tech 100\",\"tech\",\"technology\",\"mqbustqt\",\"merqube\",\"equities\",\"stocks\",\"index\",\"indices\",\"nasdaq\",\"nasdaq 100\",\"nasdaq-100\",\"ndx\",\"qqq\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"MERQUBE:MQBUSTQT\",\"market_screen_title\":\"US Tech 100\",\"new_until\":\"2026-10-21T04:00:00Z\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#A452FF\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#6627143D\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#A452FF\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#27143D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#27143D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#A452FF\",\"subaccount_id\":118,\"subcategory\":\"US Tech 100\",\"trading_hours\":\"Sun 6pm \u2013 Fri 5pm ET\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":175012425.0846,\"recent_volume\":49781968,\"search_score\":28000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXUSTECH100PERP\",\"series_title\":\"US Tech 100\",\"tags\":[\"US Tech 100\"],\"ticker\":\"KXUSTECH100PERP\",\"title\":\"US Tech 100\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"us tech 100\",\"tech 100\",\"tech\",\"technology\",\"mqbustqt\",\"merqube\",\"equities\",\"stocks\",\"index\",\"indices\",\"nasdaq\",\"nasdaq 100\",\"nasdaq-100\",\"ndx\",\"qqq\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":688814557.1518,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":190801859,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":0.0001,\"derived_decimal_count\":0,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXBTCPERP\",\"event_title\":\"BTC\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0001304132003372,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":7.7095,\"leverage_estimate\":6.3858,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":6.3805,\"10000\":6.3752,\"100000\":6.3436,\"1000000\":6.2105},\"market_id\":\"87c59f79-328c-4a2c-9471-3cc84a8f78e2\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":7.7854,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Bitcoin\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#80F5CD90\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#80CB912D\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00E9AC4F\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00F5891B\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#F3A343\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#FFAB59\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXBTCPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Bitcoin is the original cryptocurrency and the largest digital asset by market value. It is widely viewed as a decentralized store of value and the benchmark for the broader crypto market. Many traders use BTC as the reference asset for crypto sentiment, liquidity, and risk appetite. Its fixed supply and long operating history are central to its appeal. Major macro, ETF, regulatory, and institutional developments often show up in Bitcoin first.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Bitcoin Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"btc\",\"bitcoin\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"BTC\",\"market_screen_title\":\"BTC\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#F2A900\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66F7931A\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#F7931A\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#F7931A\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#F7931A\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#F7931A\",\"subaccount_id\":64,\"subcategory\":\"BTC\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":426731840.4797,\"recent_volume\":55353088,\"search_score\":27000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXBTCPERP\",\"series_title\":\"BTC\",\"tags\":[\"BTC\"],\"ticker\":\"KXBTCPERP\",\"title\":\"BTC\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"btc\",\"bitcoin\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":43205726697.2682,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":5886776766,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":0.001,\"derived_decimal_count\":1,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXETHPERP\",\"event_title\":\"ETH\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.000138811131874,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":2.2683,\"leverage_estimate\":4.8768,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":4.8737,\"10000\":4.8706,\"100000\"