or oil-exporting countries, weekly U.S. crude inventory reports, conflicts in oil-producing regions, and global economic data.\",\"expiration_date\":\"2036-10-14\",\"funding_schedule\":\"30 14 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"Pyth\",\"keywords\":[\"wti\",\"west texas intermediate\",\"crude\",\"crude oil\",\"oil\",\"energy\",\"commodities\",\"1m\",\"one month\",\"future\",\"futures\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"PYTH:Commodities.Index.WTI1M-USD\",\"market_screen_title\":\"WTI Oil\",\"new_until\":\"2026-10-21T04:00:00Z\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#D08000\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#663B2400\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#D08000\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#3B2400\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#3B2400\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#D08000\",\"subaccount_id\":95,\"subcategory\":\"Crude Oil\",\"trading_hours\":\"Sun 6pm \u2013 Fri 5pm ET\",\"trading_hours_detail\":\"Breaks Mon\u2013Thu 5\u20136pm ET\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":38576203.5675,\"recent_volume\":39958616,\"search_score\":25000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXWTIFUTURE\",\"series_title\":\"WTI Oil\",\"tags\":[\"Crude Oil\"],\"ticker\":\"KXWTIFUTURE\",\"title\":\"WTI Oil\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"wti\",\"west texas intermediate\",\"crude\",\"crude oil\",\"oil\",\"energy\",\"commodities\",\"1m\",\"one month\",\"future\",\"futures\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":255157691.0409,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":257745528,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Metals\",\"category\":\"Metals\",\"contract_size\":0.001,\"derived_decimal_count\":1,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXGOLDPERP\",\"event_title\":\"Gold\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0004654742633912,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":3.9103,\"leverage_estimate\":15.2735,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":15.2735,\"10000\":15.2735,\"100000\":15.2735,\"1000000\":15.2735},\"market_id\":\"01a08625-937b-77b5-9d31-fac411449133\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":3.9027,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Gold\",\"categories\":[\"Metals\"],\"category\":\"Metals\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#40EE9819\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#40F7D21A\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00EE9819\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00F7D21A\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#EE9819\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#F7D21A\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXGOLDPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Gold is a physical metal that has functioned as a store of value for thousands of years and is widely used as a hedge against inflation and currency weakness.\\n\\nKey factors in play: Central banks have been buying gold at an elevated pace in recent years, according to the World Gold Council, as some countries look to reduce their reliance on the US dollar. Periods of geopolitical tension also tend to boost demand for gold as a safer place to hold money. Because gold pays no interest, its price is also sensitive to Federal Reserve policy, rate expectations, and overall US dollar strength.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Federal Reserve meetings, CPI/PPI inflation releases, and comments from Fed officials.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 10 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"Pyth Gold Reference Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"gold\",\"xau\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"PYTH:GOLD\",\"market_screen_title\":\"Gold\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#F7D21A\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#663B3206\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#F7D21A\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#3B3206\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#3B3206\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#F7D21A\",\"subaccount_id\":89,\"subcategory\":\"Gold\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":32903291.4719,\"recent_volume\":8346229,\"search_score\":24000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXGOLDPERP\",\"series_title\":\"Gold\",\"tags\":[\"Gold\"],\"ticker\":\"KXGOLDPERP\",\"title\":\"Gold\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"gold\",\"xau\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":1955928616.0999,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":472020227,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Metals\",\"category\":\"Metals\",\"contract_size\":0.1,\"derived_decimal_count\":3,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXSILVERPERP\",\"event_title\":\"Silver\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0001418629401177,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":4.9033,\"leverage_estimate\":8.3012,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":8.3012,\"10000\":8.3012,\"100000\":8.3012,\"1000000\":8.2214},\"market_id\":\"01a08625-fce2-71b3-a0f6-e3aaa4a7606f\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":5.0255,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Silver\",\"categories\":[\"Metals\"],\"category\":\"Metals\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#40AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#40AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00AEB1C9\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXSILVERPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Silver combines two roles: it's held for some of the same reasons as gold, as protection against inflation or a weak dollar, and it's also an industrial material used in solar panels, electronics, and EVs.\\n\\nKey factors in play: The world has used more silver than it's mined for several years running, according to the Silver Institute, driven mainly by growing demand from solar panels and other manufacturing. The U.S. added silver to its list of critical minerals in 2025, reflecting its industrial importance. Solar makers have also been working to use less silver per panel to cut costs, which could ease that shortage over time. Silver's price still tends to move with the same broader forces as gold, like the Fed, the dollar, and inflation data.\\n\\nWhat to watch: How silver trades relative to gold (the \\\"gold/silver ratio\\\"), Federal Reserve meetings, and CPI releases.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 10 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"Pyth Silver Reference Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"silver\",\"xag\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"PYTH:XAGUSD\",\"market_screen_title\":\"Silver\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"subaccount_id\":92,\"subcategory\":\"Silver\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":24847144.4623,\"recent_volume\":4958630,\"search_score\":23000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXSILVERPERP\",\"series_title\":\"Silver\",\"tags\":[\"Silver\"],\"ticker\":\"KXSILVERPERP\",\"title\":\"Silver\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"silver\",\"xag\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":950121897.8278,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":161046170,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":0.1,\"derived_decimal_count\":3,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXSOLPERP\",\"event_title\":\"SOL\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12