y traded US companies and is weighted by market capitalization, so bigger companies like Nvidia, Microsoft and Apple move the price much more than smaller ones. It's a total return index, which means dividends are reinvested back into the index.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Company earnings, Federal Reserve interest-rate decisions, monthly jobs and inflation reports, and overall investor sentiment.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 16 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"MerQube US Large Cap TR Index\",\"keywords\":[\"us 500\",\"us500\",\"us large cap\",\"large cap\",\"mq5ct\",\"merqube\",\"equities\",\"stocks\",\"index\",\"indices\",\"s\\u0026p\",\"s\\u0026p 500\",\"sp500\",\"spx\",\"spy\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"MERQUBE:MQ5CT\",\"market_screen_title\":\"US Large Cap\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#3C50FF\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#660E133D\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#3C50FF\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#0E133D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0E133D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#3C50FF\",\"subaccount_id\":120,\"subcategory\":\"US Large Cap\",\"trading_hours\":\"Sun 6pm \u2013 Fri 5pm ET\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":17884255.7447,\"recent_volume\":1343467,\"search_score\":21000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXUS500PERP\",\"series_title\":\"US Large Cap\",\"tags\":[\"US Large Cap\"],\"ticker\":\"KXUS500PERP\",\"title\":\"US Large Cap\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"us 500\",\"us500\",\"us large cap\",\"large cap\",\"mq5ct\",\"merqube\",\"equities\",\"stocks\",\"index\",\"indices\",\"s\\u0026p\",\"s\\u0026p 500\",\"sp500\",\"spx\",\"spy\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":220064879.9787,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":16229533,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":0.01,\"derived_decimal_count\":2,\"event_subtitle\":\"\