ports, sanctions on some major producers, and energy costs, since making aluminum from raw ore requires a lot of electricity. Construction activity, car manufacturing, and global trade conditions also affect demand.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Tariff and trade policy news, energy prices in major producing regions, and global manufacturing and construction data.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 10 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"Pyth Aluminum Reference Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"aluminum\",\"aluminium\",\"metals\",\"industrial metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"ALUMINIUM\",\"market_screen_title\":\"Aluminum\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"subaccount_id\":101,\"subcategory\":\"Aluminum\",\"trading_hours\":\"Sun 6pm \u2013 Fri 5pm ET\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":94342.7176,\"recent_volume\":30687,\"search_score\":1000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXALUMINUMPERP\",\"series_title\":\"Aluminum\",\"tags\":[\"Aluminum\"],\"ticker\":\"KXALUMINUMPERP\",\"title\":\"Aluminum\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"aluminum\",\"aluminium\",\"metals\",\"industrial metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":5044709.8097,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":1656696,\"type\":\"margin\"}],\"next_cursor\":\"\",\"search_id\":\"79a5ab4c-0ea6-424c-b129-5a1cb4ff9518\"}"}, "redirectURL": "", "headersSize": -1, "bodySize": -1}, "cache": {}, "timings": {"blocked": 16.362000016197563, "dns": -1, "ssl": -1, "connect": -1, "send": 1.815999999999999, "wait": 232.93100004637242, "receive": 13.075000024400651, "_blocked_queueing": 5.292000016197562, "_workerStart": -1, "_workerReady": -1, "_workerFetchStart": -1, "_workerRespondWithSettled": -1}