 exchange infrastructure. HYPE is closely tied to activity on the platform and to the broader narrative around decentralized derivatives trading. Traders often view it as a bet on onchain market structure, trading volume, and the growth of crypto-native exchange products. Sentiment around HYPE can move with platform adoption, incentive design, fee economics, and new product launches. It is usually followed as an exchange- and infrastructure-linked crypto asset rather than a simple payments token.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Hyperliquid-Dollar Spot Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"hype\",\"hyperliquid\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"HYPE\",\"market_screen_title\":\"HYPE\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#030E0C\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66072821\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#96FCE5\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#072821\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#96FCE5\",\"subaccount_id\":77,\"subcategory\":\"HYPE\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":6667428.6294,\"recent_volume\":792097,\"search_score\":18000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXHYPEPERP\",\"series_title\":\"HYPE\",\"tags\":[\"HYPE\"],\"ticker\":\"KXHYPEPERP\",\"title\":\"HYPE\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"hype\",\"hyperliquid\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":1399570797.1069,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":204364009,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":1,\"derived_decimal_count\":4,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXXRPPERP\",\"event_title\":\"XRP\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0003534789346539,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":1.2768,\"leverage_estimate\":2.8833,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":2.8811,\"10000\":2.8693,\"100000\":2.8178,\"1000000\":2.5796},\"market_id\":\"15fe51ec-0607-45b1-ba2c-f4ea54a7420e\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":1.2474,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"XRP\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#61328FBD\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#61328FBD\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00218BBB\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00218BBB\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#50A7CD\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#50A7CD\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXXRPPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"XRP is the native asset of the XRP Ledger, a blockchain designed for fast and low-cost value transfers. It is most closely associated with payments, cross-border settlement, and crypto's long-running push into financial infrastructure. XRP has been a major asset in the market for years and often trades on both adoption narratives and regulatory headlines. Its price can react sharply to developments involving Ripple, exchange access, and policy clarity in the United States. Many traders view it as a payments-focused large-cap crypto with a distinct legal and institutional story.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' XRP-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"xrp\",\"ripple\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"XRP\",\"market_screen_title\":\"XRP\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#191B1F\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#6648484B\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#525558\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#030306\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#48484B\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#4A4951\",\"subaccount_id\":67,\"subcategory\":\"XRP\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":3677315.4259,\"recent_volume\":2935838,\"search_