ffect how much people use Uniswap, and in turn, UNI's price.\\n\\nWhat to watch: How much people are trading on Uniswap, votes on fee changes, and overall activity in the crypto market.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Uniswap-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"uni\",\"uniswap\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"UNI\",\"market_screen_title\":\"UNI\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#C645C0\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66541E52\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#C645C0\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#672260\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#541E52\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#C645C0\",\"subcategory\":\"UNI\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":554557.2935,\"recent_volume\":78293,\"search_score\":11000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXUNIPERP\",\"series_title\":\"UNI\",\"tags\":[\"UNI\"],\"ticker\":\"KXUNIPERP\",\"title\":\"UNI\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"uni\",\"uniswap\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":35111592.3447,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":4757105,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":10,\"derived_decimal_count\":5,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXSUIPERP\",\"event_title\":\"SUI\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0001242515945951,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":8.9029,\"leverage_estimate\":2.5081,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":2.5032,\"10000\":2.4838,\"100000\":2.3889,\"1000000\":1.9949},\"market_id\":\"05dac0cb-6cd8-4529-9a61-37374e8a09e3\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":8.8468,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Sui\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#8069A8EB\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#8069A8EB\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#004CA4FF\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#004CA4FF\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#4CA4FF\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#4CA4FF\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXSUIPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":4,\"description\":\"Sui is a Layer 1 blockchain built to support fast, low-cost transactions and consumer-facing applications. It uses an object-centric design and the Move programming language to help developers build apps with high throughput and responsive user experiences. SUI is used to pay network fees, participate in staking, and support activity across the broader Sui ecosystem. Traders often follow it as a bet on emerging onchain apps, gaming, and payment-style use cases. Adoption trends, network growth, and ecosystem launches can all influence sentiment around SUI.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Sui-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"sui\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"SUI\",\"market_screen_title\":\"SUI\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#4CA4FF\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#664CA4FF\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#66B2FF\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#0E1D2D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0E1D2D\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#4CA4FF\",\"subaccount_id\":73,\"subcategory\":\"SUI\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":833147.3226,\"recent_volume\":94956,\"search_score\":10000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXSUIPERP\",\"series_title\":\"SUI\",\"tags\":[\"SUI\"],\"ticker\":\"KXSUIPERP\",\"title\":\"SUI\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"sui\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":492367544.1713,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":64363041,\"type\":\"margin