across decentralized applications, and it also supports fee discounts on Binance. Traders often follow it as a proxy for usage across the BNB ecosystem and one of crypto's largest exchange-linked assets. Chain adoption, token burns, exchange activity, and regulatory developments can influence its price.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF BNB-Dollar Spot Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"bnb\",\"bnb chain\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"BNB\",\"market_screen_title\":\"BNB\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#F0B90B\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#660A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#F0B90B\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#0A0C0F\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#0C0F13\",\"subaccount_id\":107,\"subcategory\":\"BNB\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":788382.2851,\"recent_volume\":1127017,\"search_score\":8000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXBNBPERP\",\"series_title\":\"BNB\",\"tags\":[\"BNB\"],\"ticker\":\"KXBNBPERP\",\"title\":\"BNB\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"bnb\",\"bnb chain\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":41191877.5249,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":55179740,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Metals\",\"category\":\"Metals\",\"contract_size\":0.001,\"derived_decimal_count\":1,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXPLATINUMPERP\",\"event_title\":\"Platinum\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0001659503748964,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":1.4281,\"leverage_estimate\":6.6094,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":6.6094,\"10000\":6.6094,\"100000\":6.5811,\"1000000\":6.3898},\"market_id\":\"01a0c632-d5b5-73be-b6a2-0cc504110b59\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":1.4367,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Platinum\",\"categories\":[\"Metals\"],\"category\":\"Metals\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#40AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#40AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00AEB1C9\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#00AEB1C9\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXPLATINUMPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Platinum is a precious metal used in diesel catalytic converters (which reduce vehicle emissions), fuel cells, and jewelry.\\n\\nKey factors in play: Platinum's price mostly comes down to a tug of war between constrained supply and shifting demand. Mining disruptions in South Africa, the largest producer, have kept output tight, according to the World Platinum Investment Council (WPIC). Jewelry buying and hybrid vehicle catalyst use have been demand drivers, while rising EV adoption works in the other direction, since EVs need no catalytic converter at all.\\n\\nWhat to watch: Gold price moves, Federal Reserve meetings, CPI releases, and South African mine supply news.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 10 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"Pyth Platinum Reference Rate\",\"keywords\":[\"platinum\",\"xpt\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"PYTH:XPTUSD\",\"market_screen_title\":\"Platinum\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#292A30\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#AEB1C9\",\"subaccount_id\":91,\"subcategory\":\"Platinum\",\"trading_hours\":\"Sun 6pm \u2013 Fri 5pm ET\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":1160766.7577,\"recent_volume\":805333,\"search_score\":7000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXPLATINUMPERP\",\"series_title\":\"Platinum\",\"tags\":[\"Platinum\"],\"ticker\":\"KXPLATINUMPERP\",\"title\":\"Platinum\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"platinum\",\"xpt\",\"metals\",\"precious metals\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":51327962.1684,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":31198754,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":1,\"derived_decimal_count\":4,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXLINKPERP\",\"event_title\":\"LINK\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0.0001984496175397,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":11.1541,\"leverage_estimate\":3.7325,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":3.7198,\"10000\":3.6824,\"100000\":3.5014,\"1000000\":2.7942},\"market_id\":\"89a018cb-d0e9-4701-bae9-d779db7c1ef9\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":11.2702,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Chainlink\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#80A7BAFC\",\"chart_gradient_start_dark_color\":\"#800847F8\",\"chart_gradient_stop_color\":\"#00AFC0FC\",\"chart_gradient_stop_dark_color\":\"#000847F8\",\"chart_line_color\":\"#0A3EF6\",\"chart_line_dark_color\":\"#0847F8\",\"custom_image_url\":\"https://assets.kalshi.com/app_casual/margin_images/2026-09-24/KXLINKPERP.webp\",\"decimal_count\":2,\"description\":\"Chainlink is best known for building decentralized oracle infrastructure for blockchains. Its networks provide price feeds and other real-world data that smart-contract applications rely on to function. LINK is the token associated with that oracle ecosystem and is closely tied to the growth of onchain finance and automation. Traders often view it as infrastructure for the crypto economy rather than a typical payment coin. Adoption of data feeds, interoperability tools, and institutional partnerships can shape sentiment around LINK.\",\"funding_schedule\":\"0 */8 * * *\",\"index_provider\":\"CF Benchmarks' Chainlink-Dollar Real Time Index\",\"keywords\":[\"link\",\"chainlink\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"live_data_asset\":\"LINK\",\"market_screen_title\":\"LINK\",\"shareable_accent_color\":\"#0847F8\",\"shareable_layer2_background_color\":\"#66435CA1\",\"shareable_layer2_border_color\":\"#2E5FFF\",\"shareable_layer2_color\":\"#435CA1\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_bottom_color\":\"#435CA1\",\"shareable_layer2_gradient_top_color\":\"#0847F8\",\"subaccount_id\":69,\"subcategory\":\"LINK\"},\"product_metadata_derived\":{},\"recent_notional_volume\":515873.6434,\"recent_volume\":46122,\"search_score\":6000,\"series_ticker\":\"KXLINKPERP\",\"series_title\":\"LINK\",\"tags\":[\"LINK\"],\"ticker\":\"KXLINKPERP\",\"title\":\"LINK\",\"topic_keywords\":[\"link\",\"chainlink\",\"crypto\",\"perp\",\"perps\",\"perpetual\",\"perpetuals\"],\"total_market_count\":0,\"total_notional_volume\":230430039.5604,\"total_series_volume\":0,\"total_volume\":23883259,\"type\":\"margin\"},{\"active_market_count\":0,\"asset_class\":\"Crypto\",\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"contract_size\":0.01,\"derived_decimal_count\":2,\"event_subtitle\":\"\",\"event_ticker\":\"KXAAVEPERP\",\"event_title\":\"AAVE\",\"fee_multiplier\":0,\"fee_type\":\"\",\"funding_rate\":0,\"funding_time\":\"2026-11-03T12:21:16.269579Z\",\"halt_sources\":[],\"is_closing\":false,\"is_new\":false,\"is_price_delta\":false,\"is_trending\":false,\"last_price\":1.2815,\"leverage_estimate\":3.3717,\"leverage_estimates\":{\"1000\":3.3585,\"10000\":3.3094,\"100000\":3.0826,\"1000000\":2.2635},\"market_id\":\"01a045f4-92f6-79d4-8348-ba28f8d76d3b\",\"markets\":[],\"previous_price\":1.3101,\"product_metadata\":{\"asset_name\":\"Aave\",\"categories\":[\"Crypto\"],\"category\":\"Crypto\",\"chart_gradient_start_color\":\"#409391FE\",\"chart_gradient_